Recall from this <xref ref="matrixeq-row-column-prod"/> that the product of a row vector and a column vector is the scalar
        <me>\mat{a_1 a_2 \cdots, a_n} \vec{x_1 x_2 \vdots, x_n}
        = a_1x_1 + a_2x_2 + \cdots + a_nx_n.</me>

